# AGENTS.md (e2e)

This repository's `e2e/` subtree is scaffolded by `copilotcockpit`.

`e2e/` may be an independent Git repository (default scaffold behavior), or be
owned by the parent project when `bootstrap.sh e2e <dir> --no-git` is used.

## Runtime rules

- Tests are expected to run through `./run-audit.sh` for tracked executions.
- Smoke runs are first-class: `./run-audit.sh --scope "@smoke"`.
- Set `SKIP_DB_RESET=true` for shared databases.
- `./run-audit.sh` and governance files are the source of audit truth.
- Normal missions use `cockpit-queue` plus `cockpit-overseer tick`; use
  `cockpit-protocol` for durable control and log/pane diagnosis. Setup-only
  `dispatch --bootstrap` is not product dispatch; raw `send`/`nudge` are only
  diagnostic or explicitly human-requested exceptions, never mission/approval/cancel.
- Follow global `e2e-cockpit` and the role overlay for `accept-dispatch`:
  start only on `accepted` / `start_work=true` (sequence 1; dispatch 0 has no
  heartbeat), then `heartbeat` running sequence 2. Duplicates never restart work.
- `ask` / `access-prompt` record explicit prompts; `pending` / `read-question`
  return durable mission-status JSON. Only explicit human replies; correlated
  `hold --answers` is not approval. Inspect `status.pending_commands` /
  `command-status`; accepted-worker cancel/replace requires accepted then applied
  ACK with matching digest and typed `--result`. Reuse IDs/digests; journal no
  secrets. Durable lifecycle is separate from pane diagnosis.
- If the parent repo has `graphify-out/graph.json` and `graphify` is available,
  use `graphify query "<question>" --graph "$REPO/graphify-out/graph.json"`
  before broad text search for codebase, architecture, file-relationship, and
  project-content questions.

## Project overlays

- Project-specific Codex overlays live in `e2e/.agents/skills`.
- Legacy Copilot overlays may live in `e2e/.github/skills`.

## Key paths

- `e2e/run-audit.sh` — governed test runner
- `e2e/run-playwright.sh` — ad-hoc test runner
- `e2e/.env.local` — local runtime config
- `e2e/.agents/skills` — Codex overlays
- `e2e/.github/skills` — Copilot overlays
